@startuml
title Z3 uses the reject-safe bridge but cannot cross the exactness gate

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}
skinparam interface {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}

component "Z3Theory\nBool · linear integers · bit-vectors" as Z3 #FDE68A
interface "ConstraintTheory" as CT #DBEAFE
component "TheoryAlgebra<Z3Theory>\nbounded checked search" as BR #E0E7FF
rectangle "Sat3\nSat | Unsat | DontKnow" as SAT3 #FEF3C7
rectangle "Admission boundary\nDontKnow rejects" as Admission #FECACA

interface "DecidableConstraintTheory\ndecide_exact" as DCT #BBF7D0
interface "BooleanAlgebra\nTOTAL classical decision" as BA #DBEAFE
component "SFA classical operations" as SFA #CCFBF1

Z3 --> CT
CT --> BR
BR --> SAT3 : preserve unknown
SAT3 --> Admission : fail closed

DCT --> BA
BA --> SFA
Z3 ..> DCT #EF4444 : does not implement
BR ..> BA #EF4444 : forbidden without exactness

note bottom of SAT3
  A Sat model is independently rechecked.
  Unknown is never converted into Unsat.
end note

note bottom of BA
  Complement, determinization, and equivalence require
  the separate total-decision capability.
end note

legend right
|= Color |= Meaning |
|<#FDE68A> | three-valued solver |
|<#E0E7FF> | shared reject-safe adapter |
|<#FEF3C7> | preserved three-valued result |
|<#FECACA> | refusal boundary |
|<#BBF7D0> | exactness capability |
|<#DBEAFE> | classical interface |
|<#CCFBF1> | classical consumer |
endlegend
@enduml
